# Data, Professor of Humanities: "Seek out — Whenever you draw your second card each turn, create two 1/1 blue Faerie
# creature tokens with flying." Nothing here draws more than the one card of a draw step, so turn 5's single card is the
# first of that turn and is not its second (CR 121.2, 603.2): no Faerie is made. A trigger that fired on any draw would
# make two, so this scenario is what tells "second card" from "a card".

